"parentTweet": false, "likes": 3104}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATVaLOJN2", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 81, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "pocrime", "id": 8879400, "raw_content": "We kind of missed this story on this website.  It was a big story.  I'm reposting because people ought to know about it, and it casts a dark shadow on DNA testing.   It's relevant because of rapes and murders where DNA is a primary factor in the convictions.\n\nIt's also relevant because I see a trend of women who believe its their job to manipulate data out of some perceived but not real 'unfairness' or equity, or wokeness.  Or just they are incapable of doing their job right (female tech CEOs) but they're good at pretending.  Next time you have imposter syndrome, look in the mirror.  If you're a female, it might not be a syndrome.  You might just be a DEI fucker.\n\n---\n* https://coloradosun.com/2026/09/08/yvonne-missy-woods-cbi-scientist-sentenced/\n\n* https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/colorado-crime-analyst-manipulated-dna-data-sentenced-rcna596722\n\n* https://cbi.colorado.gov/forensics/yvonne-missy-woods-investigation\n\n---\nA few of us posted about it but it didn't get traction it deserved\n\n* https://patriots.win/p/1ATVCpXKSr/a-former-forensic-analyst-for-th/c\n\n* https://patriots.win/p/1ATVQtVQHw/its-not-just-the-judges-a-colora/c", "author": "5DchessWatch", "created": 1791631517310, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "H0rse", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "ICYMI: Colorado FBI employee Yvonne \u201cMissy\u201d Woods was ordered to serve 10 years behind bars after pleading guilty to messing around with DNA evidence and causing innocent people to go to prison.", "last_comment_created": 1791639779491, "content": "<p>We kind of missed this story on this website.  It was a big story.  I'm reposting because people ought to know about it, and it casts a dark shadow on DNA testing.   It's relevant because of rapes and murders where DNA is a primary factor in the convictions.</p>\n<p>It's also relevant because I see a trend of women who believe its their job to manipulate data out of some perceived but not real 'unfairness' or equity, or wokeness.  Or just they are incapable of doing their job right (female tech CEOs) but they're good at pretending.  Next time you have imposter syndrome, look in the mirror.  If you're a female, it might not be a syndrome.  You might just be a DEI fucker.</p>\n<hr />\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://coloradosun.com/2026/09/08/yvonne-missy-woods-cbi-scientist-sentenced/\" target=\"_blank\">https://coloradosun.com/2026/09/08/yvonne-missy-woods-cbi-scientist-sentenced/</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/colorado-crime-analyst-manipulated-dna-data-sentenced-rcna596722\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/colorado-crime-analyst-manipulated-dna-data-sentenced-rcna596722</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://cbi.colorado.gov/forensics/yvonne-missy-woods-investigation\" target=\"_blank\">https://cbi.colorado.gov/forensics/yvonne-missy-woods-investigation</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p>A few of us posted about it but it didn't get traction it deserved</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://patriots.win/p/1ATVCpXKSr/a-former-forensic-analyst-for-th/c\" target=\"_blank\">https://patriots.win/p/1ATVCpXKSr/a-former-forensic-analyst-for-th/c</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://patriots.win/p/1ATVQtVQHw/its-not-just-the-judges-a-colora/c\" target=\"_blank\">https://patriots.win/p/1ATVQtVQHw/its-not-just-the-judges-a-colora/c</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 5, "score_up": 81, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "\ud83d\udea8\u00a0\u00a0LOCK THEM UP\u00a0\u00a0\ud83d\udea8", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2108587887453212715", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVaLOJu6", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 60, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8879482, "raw_content": "", "author": "Belleoffreedom", "created": 1791636373412, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "boredrandomguy", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVaLOJu6.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/bennyjohnson/status/2108587887453212715?s=20", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Benny Johnson\n\n@bennyjohnson\n\u00b7\nA new report shows President Trump has cut legal immigration even more than illegal immigration.", "last_comment_created": 1791640835993, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 2, "score_up": 60, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": [{"width": 1320, "heightRatio": 98, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUM1gatXEAAljKz.jpg", "height": 1298}, {"width": 1320, "heightRatio": 126, "url": "https://pbs.twim